{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52539","headline":"酬裴使君王探公 · 陈元光","name":"酬裴使君王探公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百粤临南海，儒冠任使轺。\n馈我兼金佩，和之美玉箫。\n清风生四座，丽日正良霄。\n意气宜令契，公忠岂古饶。\n简书频诵读，玉烛要均调。\n冰监秋霄察，君门万里遥。\n骊騑歌四牡，谔谔答清朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}